#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Turn off all error mitigation and error suppression {#turn-off-all-error-mitigation-and-error-suppression}"
msgstr "Desactivar toda la mitigación y supresión de errores {#turn-off-all-error-mitigation-and-error-suppression}"

